      "created_at": "2025-08-06T14:30:10.812Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/a7medalyousofi\">@a7medalyousofi</a></p>\n<p>In your doctype, you need to set the “image” field</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/7/07a70582459168a82e008bd3c1d9babd6cdc4c6a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/07a70582459168a82e008bd3c1d9babd6cdc4c6a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/7/07a70582459168a82e008bd3c1d9babd6cdc4c6a_2_690x438.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"15Hbqfix96xthqG3EmtZ3lNg6JY\" width=\"690\" height=\"438\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/7/07a70582459168a82e008bd3c1d9babd6cdc4c6a_2_690x438.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/7/07a70582459168a82e008bd3c1d9babd6cdc4c6a_2_1035x657.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/7/07a70582459168a82e008bd3c1d9babd6cdc4c6a.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBF9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1172×744 50.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Hope this helps.</p>",
