      "cooked": "<p>Yes, I made it, but still not display in list view, see below:</p>\n<p>Where is the mistakes?</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/e/0eafd663e3c9e63699c314749c9e9bd72bb42ba8.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0eafd663e3c9e63699c314749c9e9bd72bb42ba8\" title=\"1\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0eafd663e3c9e63699c314749c9e9bd72bb42ba8_2_690x341.jpeg\" alt=\"1\" data-base62-sha1=\"25VpHLifAz57wKciHolvDhZsbH2\" width=\"690\" height=\"341\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0eafd663e3c9e63699c314749c9e9bd72bb42ba8_2_690x341.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0eafd663e3c9e63699c314749c9e9bd72bb42ba8_2_1035x511.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0eafd663e3c9e63699c314749c9e9bd72bb42ba8_2_1380x682.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">1</span><span class=\"informations\">1458×721 87.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
